osl-dynamics bundles the following neuroimaging templates, surfaces and
parcellations under osl_dynamics/files/. They are redistributed here for
convenience and remain the work of their original authors, who should be
cited when they are used.

MNI152 templates and surfaces (files/mask/MNI152_T1_*_brain.nii.gz;
    files/mni152_surfaces/)
    Derived from the MNI ICBM 152 non-linear 6th generation average brain,
    Montreal Neurological Institute, McGill University.
    Copyright (C) 1993-2009 Louis Collins, McGill University. Permission to
    use, copy, modify and distribute is granted without fee, provided that
    the copyright notice appears in all copies. The authors and McGill
    University make no representations about the suitability of this
    software for any purpose.

AAL parcellations (files/parcellation/atlas-AAL_*)
    Modified at OHBA from the Automated Anatomical Labeling atlas,
    Neurofunctional Imaging Group (GIN), Caen.
    Tzourio-Mazoyer et al. (2002), NeuroImage 15:273-289.
    The AAL readme states that it is "available to the scientific community
    as a copyright freeware under the terms of the GNU General Public
    Licence".

Desikan-Killiany parcellations (files/parcellation/atlas-DK_*)
    Modified at OHBA from FreeSurfer's aparc annotation.
    Desikan et al. (2006), NeuroImage 31:968-980.
    Distributed under the FreeSurfer Software License, which permits
    redistribution and derivative works provided its terms accompany the
    copy, modified versions are marked as such, and attributions and
    copyright notices are preserved:
    https://surfer.nmr.mgh.harvard.edu/fswiki/FreeSurferSoftwareLicense

Glasser parcellations (files/parcellation/atlas-Glasser_*)
    Glasser52: A parcellation for MEG analysis. Kohl, Woolrich, Nobre and
    Quinn, University of Oxford. Licensed under CC BY 4.0.
    https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11099418
    Derived from the HCP multi-modal parcellation (HCP-MMP1.0),
    Glasser et al. (2016), Nature 536:171-178.

Schaefer parcellations (files/parcellation/atlas-Schaefer_*)
    Schaefer et al. (2018), Cerebral Cortex 28:3095-3114.
    From the CBIG repository, licensed under the MIT License.
    Copyright (c) 2016 Computational Brain Imaging Group (CBIG).

Giles parcellations (files/parcellation/atlas-Giles_*)
    Developed at OHBA, University of Oxford.
